   │  ├─ dist/index.js:1:const x = require("@src/logic/x");
   │  └─ fix: an alias whose target sits outside the build rootDir (e.g. \`@/\` beside \`rootDir: src\`) is one tsc-alias cannot map; narrow it in tsconfig.build.json to a target under rootDir (\`"@/src/*": ["./src/*"]\`). if the narrowed alias itself is left, tsc-alias does not yet map \`paths\` with no \`baseUrl\`: keep typescript below 7 in this repo until it does
   │
   ├─ trees kept at: <temp>
   │
   └─ 💥 MalfunctionError: 1 unrewritten alias specifier under typescript@9.0.0; read .log/typescript.probe/emit/

🐢 bummer dude...
--- stderr
"
`;

